        "procedure": "Clusters 1 and 2 were obtained by reaction of Ln(dbm)3·2H2O (0.03 mmol; Ln = Gd for 1) and HL (0.03 mmol) in 20 mL acetonitrile and 3 mL CH2Cl2. The ensuing yellow solution was stirred at room temperature for about 4 h. After filtration, the solution was left unperturbed to evaporate slowly. Yellow block-shaped crystals suitable for single-crystal X-ray diffraction were isolated after about 5 days.",
